    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33504" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palmĭfer</span></b> , fĕra,
			fĕrum, adj.
		1. palmafero, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>palm-bearing</i>, <i>abounding in
				palms</i>, <i>palmiferous</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Memphin palmiferamque Pharon,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Am. 2, 13, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Thebae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					5, 5, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Idume,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					3, 600</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palmiferos Arabas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 10, 478</span></i>
			.</div>
